{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_title", "source_sha256": "8813899b54d973ea4aa5ed21d422ec048825f8ba7c9d9a660f8694364011d2c8", "ja": "因縁のうさぎ", "zh": "宿命的兔子", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e9c7498d733c9472377c6d2e784ec2129661fbbe94621a99c4afc900bfba578a", "ja": "オークションの裏帳簿を見つけたレディ・I\nたちは、扱いに悩んだ末、バニーポリスに\n匿名で送りつけようと結論を出す。そんな\n中、リトルとシャインナイトの危機を察知\nするミス・W。3人は急ぎ向かうのだった。", "zh": "发现拍卖会幕后账本的Lady I一行，经过一番苦恼后，决定匿名将账本寄给兔女郎警察。就在这时，Miss W察觉到了Little和Shine Knight的危机。3人急忙赶了过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1000_052kao", "source_sha256": "201e3d91b6e894db05137f676ef5fa02e4e65932157c7ee631e77366b1fb96b4", "ja": "ここに別のお宝がある……ですか？\nしかし、それらしき反応はありませんが……。", "zh": "这里还有别的宝物……吗？  \n可是，并没有发现类似的反应……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "167a2222d8580227f645fc6184ae5b598fa061d52dd094c9d9d402c23c16053b", "ja": "ええと、たぶんこの辺とかに……。", "zh": "嗯……大概就在这附近……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "349b8459ad4368ccdd4571e6917c16bf7795cbf2f7d390eee71d4d4c03285f72", "ja": "お～、ありました～。\nこれは……目録のようですな～。", "zh": "哦～，找到了～。\n这好像是……目录呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "d137c3f9a188186d40b8f6072f4fd58cdbeed4e27b6988fb68791c6c07cdcc55", "ja": "目録！？\nもしかして、地下オークションの……。", "zh": "目录！？\n难道是地下拍卖会的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "1fd0211669595d585286babe1345787155bdf02534ba72bbd55f2970f68a00bf", "ja": "なるほど……あえてデータ上には残さず、\nアナログでのみ記録していたのですね。", "zh": "原来如此……是故意不在数据上留下记录，只用纸笔记录啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "13ccf3b573d63c61ab18afcce931e7644dad6eab151c3b6675b20b3d33a9edb2", "ja": "どうりで、情報が手に入りにくいと思ったわ。\n小心者だけど狡猾ね、あのオークションマスター。", "zh": "难怪我觉得情报这么难弄到。那个拍卖会主办人真是胆小又狡猾呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "71e00fb1828f0a2adaae28c9321555d21898346d290ee387dc23bc76aa5d8496", "ja": "お～。こっちには、贈収賄の記録がばっちり\n書かれていますよ～。これは高く売れそうですな～。", "zh": "哦～这边清清楚楚地写着行贿受贿的记录呢～。这个看来能卖个好价钱呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "8665be5e08f4c233728347b93de2fc6cd49ab51fd98d926e9f9c25d60d292293", "ja": "目録は、私たちがいただくとして……\n帳簿のほうは、どういたしますか？", "zh": "目录就由我们收下了……\n至于账本，要怎么处理呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "71968f6313eaf389d88e073c765ae8a9e453dea3b6e733cbba6e2b0eb4987b39", "ja": "そうねえ。\nそこは、私たちの出番じゃないし。", "zh": "是啊。\n那里可不是我们的出场机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "9e247797dac3ab1b8d71f6a97ddc3a4339702ef5a3f93deafbb38c83abb69920", "ja": "だったら、バニーポリスですな～。\n匿名で送ってあげましょう～。", "zh": "那样的话，就交给兔女郎警察吧～  \n我们匿名送过去给他们吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "9dd2b52a3912b2ebc3f06c807504c4113abd1432334531712b74c161099aeb36", "ja": "そうね。たまにはあの連中に、\n花をもたせてあげてもいいんじゃない？　なんて♪", "zh": "是啊，偶尔也该让那群家伙风光一下吧？开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "bb608429d5175e1125ef223cbc3b3d0d73ee4658e39e65807eb5a59bdfcae37b", "ja": "お～。なんだか、\n因縁のライバルっぽい発言ですな～。", "zh": "哦～。这番发言，感觉很像宿命中的对手呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "42958dfff73c826b0768b8cf196a5c63c67130819e9299d3047e650b1f7bcb44", "ja": "なんだかじゃなくて、そうなの！　あの連中、\nほんと私たちのジャマばっかするんだから！", "zh": "不是“好像”，本来就是这样！那帮家伙，老是妨碍我们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "9939ca3cc036c53023941eae7e9e3362ac56ef5d8b3072d5c6fd026fdafca99b", "ja": "！　おふたりとも、入退場ログから、\nオークションマスターの移動を確認。", "zh": "！两位，从进出场记录确认了拍卖大师的移动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "34c3c672183a01607e4a353c9d9fd66970740f9e0b79e50929f00d8c8197fd28", "ja": "リトルとシャインナイトに\n危険が迫っているかと思われます。", "zh": "Little和Shine Knight似乎正面临危险。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "a5f1a4c53954b6f72d1c834e1dc5c8735754ffd58a67fb528a18c745bfa59cb3", "ja": "時間をかけすぎたわね。それじゃ、最後に……\n悪党どもを懲らしめに行こうじゃないの！", "zh": "花了太多时间了呢。那么，最后……\n去教训那些坏蛋吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "a264e5dfcc71d62aed8960a2bd842ea8376eeadbe827bc537db8708c6a7ef4c9", "ja": "仰せのままに、レディ・I！", "zh": "遵命，I女士！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_08_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "7efdfb335e2f51e022d4709cd6ba9a1945f94bc34ea37454a872fc9eb46d2628", "ja": "はい～。\n私も、どこまでもお伴しますよ～！", "zh": "好的～我也会一直陪您走下去哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
